WEBVTT

00:00:05.264 --> 00:00:07.374
I want to love you more

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:09.674
I want to give you more love

00:00:09.674 --> 00:00:15.414
I just want to hear your voice

00:00:15.414 --> 00:00:29.094
MAGIKANO

00:00:29.094 --> 00:00:35.134
As I soaked my fruit corn flakes in milk

00:00:35.134 --> 00:00:39.834
I thought about it with bedhair

00:00:41.234 --> 00:00:45.774
In front of the railroad crossing

00:00:45.774 --> 00:00:51.144
You suddenly covered your ears and stopped

00:00:52.144 --> 00:00:54.814
But listen! I want you more

00:00:54.814 --> 00:00:56.354
I want to bring you closer to my heart

00:00:56.354 --> 00:00:59.384
I want to give you more kisses

00:00:59.384 --> 00:01:03.394
I get a little lonely for some reason

00:01:03.394 --> 00:01:05.294
To tell you the truth

00:01:05.294 --> 00:01:06.964
I want to give you more love

00:01:06.964 --> 00:01:08.464
I want to bring you closer to my heart

00:01:08.464 --> 00:01:13.364
So keep your spirits higher

00:01:14.504 --> 00:01:20.514
Your smile is enough to give me a fever

00:01:20.514 --> 00:01:25.774
The fever of happiness is rising

00:01:36.724 --> 00:01:39.454
Good! Nice looking eggs sunny-side up!

00:01:39.964 --> 00:01:42.454
One level scoop of detergent?
What is "one level"?

00:01:48.304 --> 00:01:50.394
I meant to do that!

00:01:52.404 --> 00:01:54.744
It feels great to work!

00:01:58.544 --> 00:02:01.674
Mamiya has been working really hard, hasn't she?

00:02:03.884 --> 00:02:07.554
I can't believe Big Brother has completely
put his trust in Mamiya!

00:02:07.554 --> 00:02:10.064
We have to keep our eyes on her,

00:02:10.064 --> 00:02:12.624
because you never know what kind
of trouble she's going to cause next!

00:02:13.494 --> 00:02:17.334
I don't think you have to
worry about her that much.

00:02:18.734 --> 00:02:22.634
She's been doing her job properly, and besides,
she helps me with my homework and stuff, too!

00:02:24.504 --> 00:02:27.544
Wh-What is this? They're her friends now?!

00:02:27.544 --> 00:02:30.604
I'm the only one who's been worrying about her?
I totally look stupid!

00:02:30.844 --> 00:02:33.484
Is it just my imagination...

00:02:33.484 --> 00:02:36.284
or does everyone seem a little
different for some reason?

00:02:36.924 --> 00:02:39.354
Or am I just being too suspicious?

00:02:46.964 --> 00:02:51.954
Episode 3
Magi? The Dangerous Siblings?

00:03:07.854 --> 00:03:09.974
What's that noise?

00:03:14.354 --> 00:03:17.814
What are they doing in the middle of the night?

00:03:18.864 --> 00:03:20.494
They're going into Ayumi's room?!

00:03:20.494 --> 00:03:23.054
Did she use some weird magic again?

00:03:23.294 --> 00:03:25.764
No wonder everyone has been acting strange!

00:03:26.634 --> 00:03:29.234
Huh? The door to Big Brother's room is open...

00:03:29.234 --> 00:03:31.074
DON'T TELL ME HE'S IN THERE, TOO?!

00:03:31.644 --> 00:03:34.664
Hey, Ayumi! What do you think you're doing?!

00:03:36.444 --> 00:03:38.144
What is this place?

00:03:38.984 --> 00:03:41.714
It doesn't look like the real world...

00:03:44.254 --> 00:03:46.414
I wonder if Ayumi created this...

00:03:46.654 --> 00:03:49.554
At any rate, I must find Ayumi and the others!

00:03:52.794 --> 00:03:55.134
Who are you?! What are you doing?!

00:03:55.134 --> 00:03:58.724
Oh, sorry. You looked so nice from behind, I just...

00:03:59.164 --> 00:04:01.004
Big Brother?!

00:04:03.034 --> 00:04:05.444
I think I just heard a scream.

00:04:05.444 --> 00:04:10.374
But more importantly, I must fulfill my duty as the
student council president of Sakuramori Academy!

00:04:11.944 --> 00:04:15.614
Miss Yuri, do you know where Ayumi Mamiya lives?

00:04:15.614 --> 00:04:16.754
Why do you ask?

00:04:16.754 --> 00:04:18.084
According to this registry,

00:04:18.084 --> 00:04:21.754
her address is the same as
Secretary Yoshikawa's address.

00:04:24.164 --> 00:04:27.494
Class 3-B
STUDENT REGISTRY

00:04:27.634 --> 00:04:28.854
WHAT?!

00:04:29.364 --> 00:04:33.104
That's right, preventing members of the student
council from perpetrating scandalous acts

00:04:33.104 --> 00:04:35.574
is also an important job of
the student council president!

00:04:36.604 --> 00:04:38.504
That's magical power!

00:04:39.004 --> 00:04:42.404
Assault Magic, Action Mode, on!

00:04:51.154 --> 00:04:52.484
What's this?!

00:04:53.894 --> 00:04:56.754
Big Brother... Why...

00:04:56.854 --> 00:04:59.484
Oh, Maika!

00:05:00.464 --> 00:05:05.334
You're adorable and a good cook!
I'm a lucky man to have you as my sister!

00:05:05.934 --> 00:05:08.334
I'll never ever let you go!

00:05:08.604 --> 00:05:09.934
Big Brother!

00:05:09.934 --> 00:05:13.204
Big Brother wants to pat your head! Pat, pat, pat!

00:05:13.204 --> 00:05:17.164
I love it when you pat my head, Big Brother!

00:05:17.444 --> 00:05:22.584
Oh, I'm so happy! This is like a dream!

00:05:22.584 --> 00:05:23.924
Dream?

00:05:23.924 --> 00:05:27.584
No! My real Big Brother wouldn't say stuff like that!

00:05:27.794 --> 00:05:29.784
You're just an illusion!

00:05:33.264 --> 00:05:35.764
M-My ideal brother...

00:05:35.764 --> 00:05:39.434
So I guess this is a world where
my wishes are realized?

00:05:39.434 --> 00:05:42.524
But for some reason it feels so vain!

00:05:43.534 --> 00:05:46.144
Why do I have to get depressed about it anyway?

00:05:46.144 --> 00:05:48.664
This is all Ayumi's fault!

00:05:49.714 --> 00:05:51.514
Huh? What's that?

00:05:51.514 --> 00:05:53.674
A candy house?

00:05:59.954 --> 00:06:02.654
I knew it was Chiaki's dream...

00:06:02.654 --> 00:06:04.024
Is Fuyuno with you, too?

00:06:04.024 --> 00:06:04.324
She's in the back.
Is Fuyuno with you, too?

00:06:04.324 --> 00:06:05.154
She's in the back.

00:06:05.264 --> 00:06:07.254
This is the best!

00:06:07.794 --> 00:06:10.134
I'm gonna stay here forever!

00:06:10.134 --> 00:06:12.564
I'm not gonna go anywhere!

00:06:12.564 --> 00:06:15.934
No! You guys are being deceived!

00:06:15.934 --> 00:06:17.844
I'm still staying here!
How did you get fooled by such an illusion?

00:06:17.844 --> 00:06:18.504
How did you get fooled by such an illusion?

00:06:18.504 --> 00:06:18.844
You guys are witches, for goodness' sake!

00:06:18.844 --> 00:06:21.204
I just got blinded by the money!
You guys are witches, for goodness' sake!

00:06:22.014 --> 00:06:25.744
Where is the person who created this
dream in the first place?!

00:06:30.384 --> 00:06:32.554
Catch me if you can!

00:06:32.554 --> 00:06:34.754
All right, here I come!

00:06:35.154 --> 00:06:36.454
Gotcha!

00:06:38.964 --> 00:06:41.084
You're pretty, Miss President.

00:06:42.094 --> 00:06:44.764
Just call me Yuri.

00:06:45.334 --> 00:06:49.704
Okay. Yuri...

00:06:54.014 --> 00:06:56.374
What do you think you're doing?

00:06:56.374 --> 00:06:58.244
What did you do that for all of a sudden?!

00:06:58.514 --> 00:07:01.674
What are YOU doing in this dream world?

00:07:02.484 --> 00:07:04.254
What? Did you say "dream"?

00:07:04.254 --> 00:07:07.714
That's right! Ayumi is the one who's
responsible for all this!

00:07:07.924 --> 00:07:11.294
Oh, no...

00:07:11.664 --> 00:07:15.754
What is she trying to do in this
dream world anyway?

00:07:17.264 --> 00:07:20.034
How dare she toy with my emotions?!

00:07:20.034 --> 00:07:21.164
She's gonna pay for this!

00:07:26.674 --> 00:07:29.814
Here you go, Haruo! Say ah!

00:07:29.814 --> 00:07:31.074
Ah!

00:07:32.244 --> 00:07:33.084
Is it good?

00:07:33.084 --> 00:07:34.214
Yes, it's good!

00:07:34.214 --> 00:07:36.154
Then do THAT for me!

00:07:36.154 --> 00:07:37.384
Sure.

00:07:41.794 --> 00:07:43.914
For now, this is the best I can do.

00:07:44.764 --> 00:07:49.094
Okay, then, let's practice how to kiss good next!

00:07:49.434 --> 00:07:50.454
Here!

00:07:53.564 --> 00:07:57.274
Ayumi! Tell me what's going on!

00:07:57.274 --> 00:07:59.944
What's your problem? I was in
the middle of the best part!

00:07:59.944 --> 00:08:03.244
You're the ones who barged into
someone else's dream!

00:08:03.244 --> 00:08:04.584
What's the big idea?

00:08:04.584 --> 00:08:07.414
Huh? Is this inside your dream?

00:08:07.854 --> 00:08:10.924
Well, to be precise, it's a little different.

00:08:10.924 --> 00:08:12.024
This is inside Haruo's head.

00:08:12.024 --> 00:08:13.584
My head... My head hurts, Big Brother!
This is inside Haruo's head.

00:08:13.584 --> 00:08:15.354
My head... My head hurts, Big Brother!
Inside the dream Haruo's having.

00:08:15.354 --> 00:08:16.024
Inside the dream Haruo's having.

00:08:16.024 --> 00:08:18.894
Haruo has never had any decent dreams,

00:08:18.894 --> 00:08:21.564
so I'm creating one for him.

00:08:21.564 --> 00:08:25.464
Since I'm already at it, I just decided to
do the same for you guys, too. That's all!

00:08:25.464 --> 00:08:27.804
Like I'm gonna fall for that!

00:08:27.804 --> 00:08:30.644
But I sure wanted to eat more candies...

00:08:30.644 --> 00:08:34.714
I never had such a shameless dream like that!

00:08:34.714 --> 00:08:36.814
What are YOU doing here?!

00:08:36.814 --> 00:08:38.644
Well, as the student council president I was...

00:08:38.644 --> 00:08:39.544
Ayumi!
Well, as the student council president I was...

00:08:40.144 --> 00:08:42.744
What are you doing all this for, anyway?

00:08:43.254 --> 00:08:44.654
Isn't it obvious?

00:08:44.654 --> 00:08:50.864
I'm going to plant MY dream inside Haruo's dream
and turn him into the ideal man that I dream of!

00:08:50.864 --> 00:08:52.254
What did you say?!

00:08:52.824 --> 00:08:55.834
I've already finished modifying
the Haruo inside my dream!

00:08:55.834 --> 00:08:59.324
Look, this is the perfect Haruo!

00:09:07.974 --> 00:09:09.444
Did you call me?

00:09:09.444 --> 00:09:11.584
NOOOOOOOOO!

00:09:11.584 --> 00:09:13.744
Is she trying to turn Haruo into
a monster or something?!

00:09:13.744 --> 00:09:15.284
I'm so jealous of his muscles!

00:09:15.284 --> 00:09:16.954
Even as the student council president,
I disapprove of that!

00:09:16.954 --> 00:09:18.544
What's wrong with it? He's so cool!

00:09:18.724 --> 00:09:20.524
How could you toy with our Big Brother?!

00:09:20.524 --> 00:09:22.024
Unforgivable!

00:09:22.024 --> 00:09:24.924
I figured you guys would never understand it!

00:09:29.364 --> 00:09:31.634
Huh? What's this vibration?

00:09:31.634 --> 00:09:33.064
Haruo's getting ready to wake up!

00:09:33.064 --> 00:09:33.934
What?!

00:09:33.934 --> 00:09:36.574
If he wakes up this dream will disappear,

00:09:36.574 --> 00:09:38.234
along with all of us!

00:09:38.804 --> 00:09:41.014
Don't tell me you've been doing this
without knowing that?!

00:09:41.014 --> 00:09:42.814
How would I know that?

00:09:42.814 --> 00:09:43.574
What did you just say?!

00:09:43.574 --> 00:09:44.114
Anyway, we have to get out of here, quick!
What did you just say?!

00:09:44.114 --> 00:09:45.744
Anyway, we have to get out of here, quick!

00:09:46.084 --> 00:09:49.584
There's no time for arguing!
How are we supposed to get out of here?

00:09:49.584 --> 00:09:51.824
Concentrate all your magical power onto me!

00:09:51.824 --> 00:09:54.114
I'm gonna try to open up a door
into an alternate space.

00:09:54.394 --> 00:09:54.954
All right!

00:09:54.954 --> 00:09:55.154
I guess...
All right!

00:09:55.154 --> 00:09:56.024
I guess...

00:09:57.464 --> 00:09:58.794
Now concentrate!

00:10:10.374 --> 00:10:13.504
WHAT THE HELL ARE YOU THINKING ABOUT
AT A TIME LIKE THIS?!

00:10:19.684 --> 00:10:23.174
He's started to wake up!
Everyone try to concentrate!

00:10:24.084 --> 00:10:26.684
Gate of the dream world, open!

00:10:27.594 --> 00:10:30.214
Open! Open!

00:10:31.894 --> 00:10:34.954
Open! Open!

00:10:35.794 --> 00:10:38.424
OPEN!

00:10:47.744 --> 00:10:49.834
We did it... We made it!

00:10:50.544 --> 00:10:52.944
We did it! We did it! We made it!

00:10:53.344 --> 00:10:55.984
That never would've happened if you hadn't
come up with such a crazy idea in the first place!

00:10:55.984 --> 00:10:58.054
So what? Just shut up!

00:10:58.054 --> 00:11:00.994
As a member of the student council,
I will not tolerate misconduct!

00:11:00.994 --> 00:11:03.524
Hmm... What's all the noise?
That's right, Haruo is MY Big Brother!

00:11:03.524 --> 00:11:06.324
What? I'm the one who's going to make
a real man out of Haruo!

00:11:06.324 --> 00:11:08.854
Why are you making so much noise
this early in the morning?

00:11:10.164 --> 00:11:12.964
What color is your blood?

00:11:16.634 --> 00:11:22.244
YES! It must've affected his real body because
I used very powerful magic inside his head!

00:11:22.244 --> 00:11:25.014
IT WAS A BIG SUCCESS!

00:11:25.014 --> 00:11:25.484
We disapprove!
IT WAS A BIG SUCCESS!

00:11:25.484 --> 00:11:25.884
We disapprove!

00:11:25.884 --> 00:11:26.514
We disapprove!
Hidebu!

00:11:26.514 --> 00:11:27.504
Hidebu!

00:11:44.864 --> 00:11:47.434
Here you go, Big Brother! Say ah!

00:11:47.434 --> 00:11:49.764
It's okay, I can do it myself.

00:11:52.144 --> 00:11:53.664
Is it good?

00:11:55.744 --> 00:11:56.644
Big Brother! Can I take a bath with you?

00:11:56.644 --> 00:11:59.114
M-Maika! Wh-What do you think you're doing?! Hey!
Big Brother! Can I take a bath with you?

00:11:59.114 --> 00:12:00.884
NO! It's embarrassing!

00:12:00.884 --> 00:12:02.214
The maid witnessed!

00:12:02.214 --> 00:12:04.944
The naughty days of the older-brother-loving sister!

00:12:05.624 --> 00:12:08.754
The biggest reason why Haruo is such a loser
and unable to awaken to his own magical power

00:12:08.754 --> 00:12:12.324
is because Maika has been spoiling him so much.

00:12:12.324 --> 00:12:15.994
I-I do wish he was a little more manly, but...

00:12:15.994 --> 00:12:18.234
Why are you here again?

00:12:18.234 --> 00:12:20.034
Knowing that not only have
you been living with Yoshikawa,

00:12:20.034 --> 00:12:22.134
but you've also been working
as a maid in his house,

00:12:22.134 --> 00:12:24.404
it is my duty to prevent scandals from occurring!

00:12:24.404 --> 00:12:25.844
What's that supposed to mean?

00:12:25.904 --> 00:12:31.144
Um, I do agree that Maika clings to
Big Brother Haruo way too much, though.

00:12:31.684 --> 00:12:32.944
You think so too, right?!

00:12:32.944 --> 00:12:33.934
But...

00:12:34.184 --> 00:12:37.344
It's a good thing for a brother and
a sister to get along, though.

00:12:37.554 --> 00:12:40.814
"Get along"?! But there are limits
to everything, you know!

00:12:42.854 --> 00:12:46.814
There is no limit! Big Brother and
Big Sis have to get along!

00:12:49.364 --> 00:12:51.764
What's the matter, Chiaki?

00:12:52.434 --> 00:12:55.574
You see, when I was still little,

00:12:55.574 --> 00:12:58.974
Big Sis used to hate Big Brother so much!

00:12:58.974 --> 00:13:00.814
You're kidding, right?

00:13:00.814 --> 00:13:03.214
I still remember it very clearly.

00:13:03.214 --> 00:13:05.914
One day the Big Brother and Big Sis
that I loved so much were fighting,

00:13:05.914 --> 00:13:08.354
and Big Sis screamed at him, "I hate you!"

00:13:08.354 --> 00:13:12.184
It made me so sad and
I just couldn't stop crying...

00:13:12.454 --> 00:13:15.284
That's why they have to get along with each other!

00:13:15.354 --> 00:13:17.484
They have to keep it that way forever and ever!

00:13:20.164 --> 00:13:22.694
Hmm... This is pretty interesting.

00:13:22.694 --> 00:13:25.564
If I could figure out why she started to like
her brother after hating him so much,

00:13:25.564 --> 00:13:27.834
I might be able to correct her
tendency to fawn on him.

00:13:27.834 --> 00:13:30.934
Or better yet, I might be able to
turn her against Haruo!

00:13:31.604 --> 00:13:33.074
Hey!

00:13:33.074 --> 00:13:34.004
Huh?

00:13:34.004 --> 00:13:37.984
Why don't we all find out why Maika
loves her brother so much?

00:13:37.984 --> 00:13:39.844
Find out? But how?

00:13:40.314 --> 00:13:43.284
We go back to her past using
Time Highway Magic!

00:13:43.284 --> 00:13:45.274
Time Highway Magic?!

00:13:46.854 --> 00:13:48.424
Highly-advanced magic like that?

00:13:48.424 --> 00:13:51.664
You can't use it unless you're
over 18 and licensed!

00:13:51.664 --> 00:13:55.094
Besides, it sounds like it costs a lot of money!

00:13:57.164 --> 00:13:58.804
Hey, don't tell me that's...

00:13:58.804 --> 00:13:58.864
Time Highway Magic License
Ayumi Mamiya
TEMPORARY
Hey, don't tell me that's...

00:13:58.864 --> 00:14:01.304
Time Highway Magic License
Ayumi Mamiya
TEMPORARY
That's right! A Time Highway Magic License!

00:14:01.304 --> 00:14:01.534
That's right! A Time Highway Magic License!

00:14:02.734 --> 00:14:05.464
Well, actually it's a temporary license
for a limited time, though.

00:14:06.044 --> 00:14:08.944
Why do you have stuff like this, Ayumi?!

00:14:08.944 --> 00:14:10.414
Lemme guess. It's a fake...

00:14:10.414 --> 00:14:12.944
Don't worry about the small stuff!

00:14:12.944 --> 00:14:14.604
More importantly, you wanna go or not?

00:14:15.614 --> 00:14:17.154
Of course I'm going!

00:14:17.154 --> 00:14:19.384
An opportunity like this is hard to come by, right?

00:14:19.784 --> 00:14:22.224
You know what they say! Seeing is believing!

00:14:22.224 --> 00:14:24.924
Now it's decided! Put these suits on, then!

00:14:25.864 --> 00:14:29.464
Remember, this is a temporary license
for a limited time.

00:14:29.464 --> 00:14:33.604
Which means we have to wear the designated
outfit, and we can't use it for long.

00:14:33.604 --> 00:14:37.574
If we don't get down to business quickly
we'll be forced to come back, so be careful!

00:14:37.574 --> 00:14:41.014
Wh-What if someone sees us dressed like this...

00:14:41.014 --> 00:14:46.574
Don't worry, the people at the place we're
heading to can't see us or hear our voices.

00:14:47.044 --> 00:14:48.884
All right, are we ready?

00:14:49.384 --> 00:14:51.584
Open, Gate of Time!

00:14:52.284 --> 00:14:55.584
Let us be time travelers!

00:15:03.334 --> 00:15:05.094
Good morning!

00:15:07.504 --> 00:15:11.304
Stop clinging on to me like that!
People might get the wrong idea!

00:15:12.674 --> 00:15:18.374
I'm just so happy now that I'm in middle school
and I get to be in the same school building as you!

00:15:23.584 --> 00:15:25.124
Oww...

00:15:25.124 --> 00:15:27.884
I can't believe we came out of midair...

00:15:28.394 --> 00:15:29.224
Marshmallow...

00:15:29.224 --> 00:15:29.894
Oh, no!
Marshmallow...

00:15:29.894 --> 00:15:31.364
Are you all right, Big Brother?!

00:15:31.364 --> 00:15:32.464
Y-Yeah...

00:15:32.464 --> 00:15:34.724
Something soft just came down on me...

00:15:35.634 --> 00:15:37.664
Why did we end up at school?

00:15:37.664 --> 00:15:39.964
Because it was locked on to Maika's location.

00:15:40.404 --> 00:15:42.734
It does look like we traveled back to the past, but...

00:15:42.874 --> 00:15:45.464
Those two look exactly the same as in the present.

00:15:45.774 --> 00:15:49.214
Maika is in 7th grade, so that means
this is last spring.

00:15:49.214 --> 00:15:52.044
We have to go back to when
she was much younger.

00:15:52.384 --> 00:15:57.154
Like I said, I'm only temporarily licensed
to use this magic for a limited time!

00:15:57.154 --> 00:16:00.454
To get to the time I really want,
I have to make several jumps!

00:16:00.454 --> 00:16:02.154
Then let's go now!

00:16:02.154 --> 00:16:03.244
I know!

00:16:03.654 --> 00:16:05.524
Hey, Yoshikawa!

00:16:05.994 --> 00:16:07.254
Isn't that...

00:16:09.194 --> 00:16:10.594
Good morning, Kurosu!

00:16:10.594 --> 00:16:12.824
Good morning! It's a beautiful morning, isn't it?

00:16:14.574 --> 00:16:16.104
Did you need something from me?

00:16:16.104 --> 00:16:20.764
Well, actually I accidentally made too much food
for my lunch today, so...

00:16:21.214 --> 00:16:22.334
Huh?

00:16:25.384 --> 00:16:27.784
It'd be great if you would have it,

00:16:27.784 --> 00:16:30.774
and if you don't mind, maybe
we can eat it together...

00:16:33.324 --> 00:16:34.524
NO WAY!

00:16:34.524 --> 00:16:38.154
I've already made his lunch, so forget about it!

00:16:40.394 --> 00:16:42.094
Same as usual...

00:16:42.094 --> 00:16:43.164
I know...

00:16:43.164 --> 00:16:45.834
I'm sorry, Kurosu.
I'll have to pass on that today...

00:16:45.834 --> 00:16:49.174
I-I see. Too bad, but it's okay.

00:16:49.174 --> 00:16:51.374
What's up with his sister?!

00:16:51.374 --> 00:16:54.344
What's so bad about having lunch together?

00:16:54.344 --> 00:16:56.274
But...

00:16:56.274 --> 00:17:00.814
She could be my future sister-in-law,

00:17:00.814 --> 00:17:03.754
and if I look at it that way, her being
jealous like that is sort of cute!

00:17:05.024 --> 00:17:08.294
I-I can't believe I just imagined
something so indecent!

00:17:08.294 --> 00:17:10.554
I must restrain myself.

00:17:10.824 --> 00:17:13.724
Oh man, what incredible powers
of recuperation...

00:17:14.494 --> 00:17:17.864
That was more like incredible powers
of delusion than recuperation.

00:17:18.164 --> 00:17:22.064
Neither Maika nor Yuri have changed
much at all, have they?

00:17:25.944 --> 00:17:28.674
All right, let's keep on moving on
to the next one!

00:17:38.954 --> 00:17:42.524
You're gonna be with me forever, Big Brother.
You're gonna be with me forever, Big Brother.

00:17:42.524 --> 00:17:44.364
You're gonna be with me forever, Big Brother.

00:17:44.364 --> 00:17:47.834
You're gonna be with me forever, Big Brother.
You're gonna be with me forever, Big Brother.

00:17:47.834 --> 00:17:50.034
You're gonna be with me forever, Big Brother.

00:17:50.034 --> 00:17:53.804
You're gonna be with me forever, Big Brother.
You're gonna be with me forever, Big Brother.

00:17:53.804 --> 00:17:57.234
Man, that's called brainwashing!

00:17:57.234 --> 00:17:59.504
The fundamental cause of the problem
runs really deep, doesn't it?

00:17:59.504 --> 00:18:02.944
Judging from how severely attached
Maika is to her brother,

00:18:02.944 --> 00:18:05.314
there has to be a hell of a reason behind it!

00:18:05.714 --> 00:18:09.774
I wonder what kind of secret that is!
Now I'm getting really excited!

00:18:19.824 --> 00:18:22.524
For some reason things seem extremely tense!

00:18:22.794 --> 00:18:25.064
This is pretty serious, isn't it?

00:18:26.334 --> 00:18:30.434
I hate you, Big Brother!

00:18:31.304 --> 00:18:34.464
See, I told you!

00:18:36.644 --> 00:18:39.444
Maika's eyes are filled with hatred...

00:18:39.444 --> 00:18:41.934
What's going to happen next?

00:18:42.414 --> 00:18:44.474
Big Brother...

00:18:45.054 --> 00:18:46.524
You murderer!

00:18:46.524 --> 00:18:50.224
D-Did she just call him a murderer or something?!

00:18:50.224 --> 00:18:52.124
It did sound like that, but...

00:18:52.124 --> 00:18:54.494
We must've heard it wrong, I bet.

00:18:54.494 --> 00:18:56.334
Y-You're right!

00:18:56.334 --> 00:18:56.394
I had no choice...
Y-You're right!

00:18:56.394 --> 00:18:57.954
I had no choice...

00:19:01.274 --> 00:19:03.734
It was self-defense.

00:19:03.734 --> 00:19:06.204
She was a bad person, anyway.

00:19:06.574 --> 00:19:08.374
But how could you burn her to death?

00:19:08.374 --> 00:19:10.414
Burn her to death?!

00:19:10.414 --> 00:19:13.544
If I didn't, we would've been burnt to death instead.

00:19:13.914 --> 00:19:17.284
Don't worry, that old hag was living by herself.

00:19:17.554 --> 00:19:20.184
If you keep it a secret, no one will find out.

00:19:20.354 --> 00:19:22.094
Besides...

00:19:22.094 --> 00:19:25.494
You were with me when I did it.

00:19:26.524 --> 00:19:29.464
And that makes US accomplices in the crime.

00:19:29.564 --> 00:19:31.634
D-Did we just...

00:19:31.634 --> 00:19:33.704
...witness their past...

00:19:33.704 --> 00:19:35.334
...that we weren't...

00:19:35.334 --> 00:19:37.534
...supposed to witness?!

00:19:39.144 --> 00:19:42.744
Now I understand why Maika
began to like her brother!

00:19:42.744 --> 00:19:44.374
They committed a crime together...

00:19:44.374 --> 00:19:46.604
A crime that no one must find out about...

00:19:46.784 --> 00:19:50.214
In the end the two formed a strong bond...

00:19:50.214 --> 00:19:52.384
That strong bond shared only by accomplices...

00:19:52.384 --> 00:19:53.424
What do we do now?

00:19:53.424 --> 00:19:56.094
There's no way we can tell anyone!

00:19:56.094 --> 00:19:58.424
We're going to keep it a secret
only among ourselves!

00:19:58.424 --> 00:19:59.524
That time...

00:19:59.524 --> 00:20:02.234
That time, if only you hadn't...

00:20:02.234 --> 00:20:04.134
if only you hadn't...

00:20:04.134 --> 00:20:06.824
entered the candy house!

00:20:07.204 --> 00:20:09.174
CANDY HOUSE?!

00:20:09.174 --> 00:20:10.804
Thank you, Big Brother!

00:20:10.804 --> 00:20:13.074
Thanks to you I can say it better now!

00:20:13.074 --> 00:20:16.534
I can say the line, "I hate you, Big Brother!"

00:20:16.944 --> 00:20:18.784
It's an easy line to say.

00:20:18.784 --> 00:20:24.184
But you know I love you very, very,
very much, Big Brother!

00:20:25.484 --> 00:20:29.754
Big Brother, Big Sis, I don't want you to fight!

00:20:31.294 --> 00:20:33.264
We weren't fighting, Chiaki.

00:20:33.264 --> 00:20:36.594
But still, the story is a little odd.

00:20:37.264 --> 00:20:39.404
In Hansel and Gretel,

00:20:39.404 --> 00:20:42.304
it's Gretel who's supposed to burn
the evil witch to death...

00:20:42.434 --> 00:20:45.174
What does "accomplices" mean?

00:20:45.174 --> 00:20:47.074
It's a hard word, isn't it?

00:20:47.074 --> 00:20:49.174
Does this mean...

00:20:49.174 --> 00:20:51.744
Yeah, it does...

00:20:51.744 --> 00:20:54.274
They're practicing for a play...

00:20:54.444 --> 00:20:56.974
See, I was right!

00:20:57.084 --> 00:20:58.744
YOU IDIOT!

00:20:59.854 --> 00:21:03.154
I wasted my time and magic thanks to you!

00:21:03.154 --> 00:21:09.634
I guess only the fighting part made it
into Chiaki's memory.

00:21:09.634 --> 00:21:12.754
That's kinda understandable...
Oh well, it's a cute little story, isn't it?

00:21:13.804 --> 00:21:15.174
Now that it's come to this,

00:21:15.174 --> 00:21:18.704
I'll go further back into the past and find out
why she's so obsessed with her brother!

00:21:18.704 --> 00:21:19.964
Come on, everyone!

00:21:45.104 --> 00:21:47.934
Mom, she stopped crying!

00:21:47.934 --> 00:21:51.874
Oh my! Nothing could stop her from crying before.

00:21:51.874 --> 00:21:56.914
Maika must've loved her big brother Haruo
since the day she was born!

00:21:56.914 --> 00:21:58.974
Since the day she was born?!

00:21:59.044 --> 00:22:03.814
What's that supposed to mean?!
Are we talking about DNA now?!

00:22:10.294 --> 00:22:13.264
MAGIKANO

00:22:19.734 --> 00:22:26.174
This is a secret, but I am a little different

00:22:26.174 --> 00:22:32.384
Do I look ordinary or cute? Yeah! Yeah!

00:22:32.384 --> 00:22:35.854
I know I'm mellow and mediocre

00:22:35.854 --> 00:22:38.924
But so what? So what?

00:22:38.924 --> 00:22:42.024
But just as I was thinking that

00:22:42.024 --> 00:22:45.394
I got myself mixed up in trouble

00:22:45.394 --> 00:22:48.394
I'm not going to lose, I'm not going to give you up

00:22:48.394 --> 00:22:51.764
Because you are precious to me

00:22:51.764 --> 00:22:58.224
Maybe I should not cast a spell

00:22:59.774 --> 00:23:02.944
I don't want magic to be

00:23:02.944 --> 00:23:06.084
The reason why it's this way

00:23:06.084 --> 00:23:12.624
When it comes to love, it has to be real

00:23:12.624 --> 00:23:19.024
Who are you in love with?

00:23:19.024 --> 00:23:25.154
Everyone is dying to know the answer!

00:23:25.434 --> 00:23:28.504
Seriously, I have to guard you
from the love scramble that is about to begin

00:23:28.504 --> 00:23:30.094
It's a pinch! Here comes my punch!

00:23:37.474 --> 00:23:41.684
Our house was broken into and
Mamiya's important thing got stolen!

00:23:41.684 --> 00:23:46.584
All right, we're going to lure the thief to our house
again and recover the stolen item!

00:23:47.254 --> 00:23:49.854
We're going to hang some lingerie outside
with photos of Maika and the others

00:23:49.854 --> 00:23:51.254
and leave the door unlocked!

00:23:51.254 --> 00:23:54.494
But is the thief really going to come back?

00:23:55.494 --> 00:23:57.094
Next time on Magikano:

00:23:57.094 --> 00:23:58.824
"Magi? It's Stolen?"

00:23:59.164 --> 00:24:01.764
Have you ever felt the true
power of the Magikano?
